# Local development only (`pnpm everyapp dev`). Copy to .dev.vars; never commit it.
# Deployed, the app has no secrets: the gateway holds every key.
#
# AI: the app calls models through the gateway's AI proxy. With no gateway in
# development, one provider key here is used directly (billed to you).
#
# Workers AI (the default, AI_PROVIDER=workers-ai): an API token with
# "Workers AI Read" and its account id.
# WORKERS_AI_API_TOKEN=
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
#
# Or OpenRouter: run with AI_PROVIDER=openrouter in the environment.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
#
# Email: sends are logged unless these are set (Email Sending REST API).
# EMAIL_REST_API_TOKEN=
# EMAIL_FROM=
